OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'amazing' lifelong
OL,4,Acharity fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who spent her life raising tens
OL,7,Fof thousands of pounds for charity has
OL,8,Fbeen remembered as an "amazing" woman
OL,9,Fby her friends.
OL,11,FMyra Baty, from Clifton in Bristol,
OL,12,Fdevoted her time to raising money for
OL,13,Fthe city's children's hospital, animal
OL,14,Fcharities and cancer service. She died
OL,15,Faged 90 on 10 November in Southmead
OL,16,FHospital from conditions relating to
OL,17,Fold age.
OL,19,FThroughout her life, she organised
OL,20,Fglamorous balls at hotels, including
OL,21,Fthe Marriott, and also hosted events at
OL,22,Fher home.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
