OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'amazing' lifelong
OL,4,Acharity fundraiser
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicky Lukaszewicz, who works as a
OL,7,Fcardiac sister at the Bristol Heart
OL,8,FInstitute, said Baty was "an
OL,9,Finspirational amazing lady" and her
OL,10,Ffavourite saying was that she just
OL,11,Fwanted to be a "good human being".
